## Worked example: a defensive buff

`Toughness` (Fortitude discipline) — a self-only large soak buff,
short-duration.

```
POD_init_combat_move = {
    DECISION   = POD_combat_move_toughness
    SKILL_KEY  = toughness
    CATEGORY   = DEF
    CONFIG     = fortitude
    AP_COST    = @ap_cost_minor  # 2
    AI_WEIGHT  = 8
    TARGETING  = self
}
scope:new_combat_move = {
    POD_combat_move_set_soak_buff_round = { TIER = 3 }   # +30 soak this round only
}
```

```
POD_combat_move_toughness = {
    picture = { reference = @texture_fortitude }
    is_valid_showing_failures_only = {
        has_trait = fortitudediscipline
        has_perk = toughness_perk
    }
    decision_group_type = hidden
    ai_check_interval = 0
    confirm_text = blank_line
}
```

```yaml
 POD_combat_move_toughness: "Toughness"
 POD_combat_move_toughness_desc: "[PODCombatMoveDesc('POD_combat_move_toughness')]"
 POD_combat_move_toughness_tooltip: " Harden body"
```

A Fortitude vampire spends 2 AP for a turn of +30 soak — letting them
weather one big hit, then the buff fades. Pairs well with a defensive
turn (Guard, Dodge) for an even stiffer-armoured stance.

