## Numeric constants reference

All declared at the top of `devpod/common/scripted_effects/POD_combat/pod_combat_move_list_effects.txt`. Editing one value here rebalances every move that references the constant. Move authors should prefer constants over raw integers so a global rebalance is one edit.

| Constant family | Values |
|---|---|
| `@ap_cost_*` | `_tiny=1`, `_minor=2`, `_medium=3`, `_major=4`, `_massive=5`, `_maximum=6` |
| `@energy_cost_*` | `_tiny=1`, `_minor=2`, `_medium=3`, `_major=4`, `_massive=5`, `_maximum=6` |
| `@stress_cost_*` | `_minor=10`, `_medium=20`, `_major=40`, `_massive=80` |
| `@gold_cost_*` | `_minor=15`, `_medium=50`, `_major=150`, `_massive=500` |
| `@piety_cost_*` | `_minor=50`, `_medium=100`, `_major=250`, `_massive=500` |
| `@prestige_cost_*` | `_minor=50`, `_medium=100`, `_major=250`, `_massive=500` |
| `@damage_*` | `_tiny=1`, `_minor=2`, `_medium=3`, `_major=4`, `_massive=5`, `_maximum=6` |
| `@morale_damage_*` | `_tiny=1`, `_minor=2`, `_medium=3`, `_major=4`, `_massive=5`, `_maximum=6` |
| `@self_damage_*` | `_tiny=1`, `_minor=2`, `_medium=3` |
